        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur ARCARC-DB, Arched Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Arc Deadbolt has a timeless elegance that allows it to blend seamlessly into almost any decor. The arched design brings just a bit of movement that keep this door lock interesting. This arched deadbolt is available as both a single cylinder (keyed lock on the outside with thumb turn inside) or a double cylinder (keyed lock on both outside and inside). Choose from a wide array of finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur ARCARC-DB Arc Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Arched Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Arched Rose Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Arched Rose Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Cylinder Projection: 0.63\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/4\" to 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-deadbolt.pdf?v=1704262180\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur Deadbolt Exploded View (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-ARCARCDB-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262326\" target=\"new\"><b>Arc Deadbolt Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from both the exterior and the interior.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Arched Deadbolt | Arc Deadbolt",
                "description": "The Arc Deadbolt has a timeless elegance that allows it to blend seamlessly into almost any decor. The arched design brings just a bit of movement that keep this door lock interesting. This arched deadbolt is available as both a single cylinder (keyed lock on the outside with thumb turn inside) or a double cylinder (keyed lock on both outside and inside). Choose from a wide array of finishes.\r\n\r\n",
